@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070/api
# Collez ici le jeton renvoyé par register ou login
@token =

### Inscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marie",
  "email": "marie@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasse123"
}

### Connexion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasse123"
}

### Nouvelle mesure
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 8.4,
  "moment": "TwoHoursAfterMeal",
  "note": "Après le dîner"
}

### Historique (filtre facultatif : ?moment=Fasting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
